@startuml USEI11 - System Sequence Diagram

actor "Infrastructure Planner" as Planner
participant ":System" as System

Planner -> System : request upgrade order computation
activate System
System --> Planner : upgrade order or cycle information
deactivate System

Planner -> System : request cycle analysis
activate System
System --> Planner : cycle details (stations and edges)
deactivate System

@enduml
